  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pigs That Ran Straightaway Into the Water, Triumph Of**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Mobile**: back after 43 archived shows (565 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Hebrews**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Transjordanian Blues**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Spent Gladiator**: back after 130 archived shows (2136 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2023-04-12.sbd.matrix** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 20 songs; 92 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Venue sound engineer Brandon mixed the show and allowed the taper to connect to the board at The District [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2023-04-12.sbd.matrix**: taped by roffels; source: Soundboard - Zoom f6 32-bit 96khz Neumann KM140 cardioid mics - Zoom f6 32-bit 96 khz [1]. Also: Matrix of a soundboard feed, patched in from the board, combined with audience mics recorded at front-of-board position; Gear: Zoom F6 recorder at 32-bit/96kHz, Neumann KM140 cardioid mics; synced in Vegas 20, mastered in Ozone, split in Audacity [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by A.A. Cristi: [The Mountain Goats Come To The District In April 2023](https://www.broadwayworld.com/sioux-falls/article/The-Mountain-Goats-Come-To-The-District-In-April-2023-20221213) [3]",
